          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJoshuwa wasebiza abakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sabakoManase, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi kubo: Likwenzile konke lokho uMose inceku yeNkosi eyalilaya khona, lalilalela ilizwi lami kukho konke engalilaya khona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kalibalahlanga abafowenu kulezinsuku ezinengi; kuze kube lamuhla linanzelele ukugcina ukulaya kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesike iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ibanikile abafowenu ukuphumula njengokubathembisa kwayo. Ngakhoke buyelani emakhaya enu elizweni lakini, alinika lona uMose inceku yeNkosi ngaphetsheya kweJordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liqapheiise ukugcina umlayo lomthetho uMose inceku yeNkosi alilaya wona, ukuba lithande iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, lihambe endleleni zayo zonke, ligcine imilayo yayo, libambelele kuyo, liyikhonze ngenhliziyo yenu yonke langomoya wenu wonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasebabusisa uJoshuwa ebayekela behamba, basuka baya emakhaya abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingxenye yesizwe sakoManase uMose wayeyinike indawo eBashani; kodwa enye ingxenye uJoshuwa wayeyinike indawo phansi kwabafowabo elizweni ngasempumalanga kweJordani. Nxa uJoshuwa ebathumela emakhaya abo, wababusisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi kibo: Buyelani emakhaya enu lilenotho enengi lenkomo ezinengi lesiliva legolide lethusi lensimbi lezigqoko ezinengi; lahlukaniselane impango yezitha zenu labafowenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase babuyela emakhaya behlukana labakoIsrayeli eShilo elizweni laseKanani, baya elizweni laseGileyadi elaliyilizwe labo ababelinikwe nguMose ngomlayo weNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekufikeni kwabo eGelilothi eliseKanani ngaseJordani abakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase bakha khona ialtare elikhulu ngaseJordani, lalilialtare elikhulu okumangalisayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli bezwa kuthiwa: AbakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase bakhile ialtare ngasemngceleni welizwe laseKanani eGelilothi ngaseJordani endaweni engeyabakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi nxa abakoIsrayeli bekuzwa lokhu, ixuku lonke labantu labuthana eShilo ukuba lilwe labo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bathumela kwabakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase elizweni laseGileyadi uFiniyasi indodana kaEleyazare umpristi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ehamba lenduna ezilitshumi, inye esizweni sinye sakoIsrayeli, yileyo laleyo iyinhloko yomuzi ezizweni zakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafika kwabakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase elizweni laseGileyadi, bathi kibo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibandla lonke leNkosi lithi: Iyini linkohliso eliyenze kuNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli ekuphambukeni kwenu lamhla ekuyilandeleni iNkosi ngokuzakhela ialtare lamhla, lihlamuka iNkosi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumbulani isono sethu sasePeyori esingazihlambululi kuso okwathi ngenxa yaso kwehlela phezu kwebandla leNkosi umkhuhlane. Sasisincinyane yini ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba liphambuke lamhla ekuyilandeleni iNkosi na? Uba liyihlamuka iNkosi lamhla, izalithukuthelela lonke ibandla lakoIsrayeli kusasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uba ilizwe lenu lingcolile, chaphelani elizweni leNkosi lapho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " leNkosi likhona, lizizuzele indawo phakathi kwethu; kodwa lingayihlamuki iNkosi loba lisenze thina siyihlamuke ngokuzakhela ialtare elingesilo ialtare leNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumbulani ukuthi uAkani indodana kaZera wenza okubi ngezinto ezinikelwe eNkosini, lolaka lwehlela phezu kwalo lonke ibandla labakoIsrayeli. Kabhubhanga yedwa ngenxa yobubi bakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoRubeni labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwe sakoManase baphendula inhloko zezindlu zakoIsrayeli bathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi inguNkulunkulu wabonkulunkulu, iNkosi inguNkulunkulu wabonkulunkulu, yona iyazi, loIsrayeli kufanele akwazi. Uba bekuyikuhlamuka loba kuyikuphambuka eNkosini lingasiyekeli lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba besizakhele ialtare ngoba siqonde ukuyitshiya iNkosi, loba sinikelele iminikelo yokutshiswa loba iminikelo yempuphu loba iminikelo yokuthula kulo, iNkosi uqobo kayiphindisele kithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa sikwenze ngokwesaba ukuthi esikhathini esizayo abantwana benu bazakuthi kwabethu: Lilani leNkosi, uNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi ilenzile iJordani laba ngumngcele phakathi kwethu lani; lina bakoRubeni labakoGadi kalilasabelo eNkosini. Abantwana benu benze abethu ukuba bayekele ukuyikhonza iNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke sasesisithi: Kasakheni ialtare lingabi ngelomnikelo wokutshiswa lelomhlatshelo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa libe ngelobufakazi phakathi kwethu lani laphakathi kwezizukulwana zethu ezizayo, ukuba siyayikhonza iNkosi ngeminikelo yethu yokutshiswa langemihlatshelo langeminikelo yokuthula, funa abantwana benu bathi kwabethu esikhathini esizayo: Kalilasabelo eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasesisithi uba bazakutsho njalo kithi lasebantwaneni bethu esikhathini esizayo, sizakuthi: Khangelani umfanekiso wealtare leNkosi elakhiwa ngobaba bengalakheli iminikelo yokutshiswa lemihlatshelo, kodwa ukuba libe yibufakazi phakathi kwethu lani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakube khatshana lathi ukuba siyihlamuke iNkosi, lokuba siphambuke lamhla ekuyilandeleni ngokwakha ialtare lomnikelo wokutshiswa lomnikelo wempuphu lomhlatshelo, elingesilo ialtare leNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu elimi phambi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
