          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uFiniyasi umpristi lezinduna zebandla eziyizinhloko zemizi yakoIsrayeli ezazilaye bewezwa amazwi akhulunywa ngabakoRubeni labakoGadi labakoManase, abathokozisa kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UFiniyasi indodana kaEleyazare umpristi wasesithi kwabakoRubeni labakoGadi labakoManase: Lamhla siyazi ukuba iNkosi iphakathi kwethu, ngoba kalenzanga inkohliso eNkosini; libakhulule abakoIsrayeli esandleni seNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UFiniyasi indodana kaEleyazare umpristi lezinduna babuyela eKanani ebantwini bakoIsrayeli bevela kwabakoRubeni labakoGadi elizweni leGileyadi, bababikela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umbiko wabo wabathokozisa abakoIsrayeli, bambonga uNkulunkulu, bayekela ukukhuluma ngokubahlasela ukuba bachithe ilizwe ababehlala kulo abakoRubeni labakoGadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoRubeni labakoGadi balibiza ialtare lelo ngokuthi yiBufakazi, ngoba bathi: Liyibufakazi phakathi kwethu bokuba iNkosi inguNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.34",
